[en.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_POLICY]
Military Reform

[en.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_POLICY_desc]
The main reason for the current difficulties of the Equestia Empire is the insufficient military strength of the Empire, which is too weak to control the various local forces. Therefore, it is urgent to strengthen the military power of the Empire.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_POLICY]
军事改革

[zh.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_POLICY_desc]
造成小马利亚帝国当前困难的主要原因就是帝国的军事实力不足，无法控制各个地方势力。因此，强化帝国的军事力量刻不容缓。

